<cem:title lang="" subtitle="">Lesson Test</cem:title>
<cem:description lang="">This virtual learning object "Lesson Test" that makes part of the lesson No: 15, Peter and Sally Plan a Road Trip which belongs to English teaching Elementary (A2.2), is intended to work on: identify ways of improving aspects of communication in English based on the learning outcomes for level A2; accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations; describe rooms, homes and objects in buildings in common social and work situations; describe characteristics of different people and their jobs; identify and describe plans for the organization of events. The purpose of this object is to: ask for or report about things, actions, events, or people; ask for and give permission; make and respond to requests; tell stories and anecdotes; describe an accident or a sickness; exchange written or oral information with a distant interlocutor. It evaluates, grammar, vocabulary, and pronunciation.</cem:description>
